Usage: bill.lam [OPTIONS] TOTAL

  Split a bill among some people, with a tip.

Arguments:
  TOTAL  The total of the bill  [required]

Options:
  -p, --people INT  How many people pay  [default: 2]
  --tip FLOAT       The tip (0.1 is 10%)  [default: 0.1]
  --payer STRING    Who paid it (to pay back)
  --help            Show this message and exit
